  "details": "If you are the first person into an instance, you can't rotate pickups for about 8 seconds. After that, it just starts working. If someone is already in the instance it seems to just work immediately without the short delay.\n\nThe cube is just a vrc pickup set to kinematic.\n\nI've tested this in some worlds. And it seems to be consistent for me.\n\nTest world: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_fcec062c-104d-412f-8f14-ebff897e2eb0",
